{"id":"n69535-2-7","stage":4,"title":"아기자기하다 · 有滋有味","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69535-2-7-1","ko":"정말 우리 스무살 때에는 돈이 없어도 재미있었는데.","zh":"真的，我们二十岁那会儿就算没钱也很开心啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"스무살","meaning":"二十；岁","explanation":"스무：二十；살：岁。","readings":[{"term":"스무","audio":"/audio/f2a3c2a22b0891b766bf.mp3"},{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17822","senseId":"1","lemma":"스무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"67887","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"스무살","audio":"/audio/1f05fe7f3b46bcc42e45.mp3"}},{"text":"때에는","meaning":"期间，时候","explanation":"때：期间，时候；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"6","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때에는","audio":"/audio/242af32f582a9e2ff71b.mp3"}},{"text":"돈이","meaning":"钱，金钱，钱币","explanation":"돈：钱，金钱，钱币；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"1","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈이","audio":"/audio/6fc43b50168ec9dd1ba6.mp3"}},{"text":"없어도","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어도","audio":"/audio/de2197ff2f4dd96bab39.mp3"}},{"text":"재미있었는데.","meaning":"有趣，有意思","explanation":"재미있다：有趣，有意思；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"재미있다","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71212","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재미있었는데","audio":"/audio/21c61293e7bada709a17.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"f2a3c2a22b0891b7","term":"스무","zh":"二十","audio":"/audio/f2a3c2a22b0891b766bf.mp3","entryId":"17822","definition":"二十的。","pronunciation":["스무"]},{"id":"d804a5a98c800c56","term":"살","zh":"岁","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3","entryId":"67887","definition":"计算年龄的数量单位。","pronunciation":["살"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"期间，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"在某一时期内。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，金钱，钱币","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"买卖商品或作为劳动代价支付或收取的硬币或纸币。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"e2360d9fd7642ddd","term":"재미있다","zh":"有趣，有意思","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3","entryId":"71212","definition":"有欢欣愉悦的感觉。","pronunciation":["재미읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/069b11d6a6cb5d280457.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69535-2-7-2",